{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pixel medieval art style, emphasizing leisure and entertainment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixel Knight, Pixel Orc, Pixel Landscape, make people feel relaxed and happy, even if you lose, you won't feel sad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The situation of the war is ever-changing, unleash your intelligence and wit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, each type of army has its own characteristics, requiring you to use your intelligence, arrange troops reasonably, and avoid being &quot;stolen&quot; by enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Have fun with friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After opening the game room, invite your friends to join the game in the chat window and organize a big fight between your &quot;little people&quot; and the other party's &quot;little people&quot;.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3439190?t=1744953362","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3439190?t=1744953362","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439190/033fc13c8adde71c6d35e779acb3686059ff121a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744953362","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439190/033fc13c8adde71c6d35e779acb3686059ff121a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744953362","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pixel medieval art style, emphasizing leisure and entertainment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixel Knight, Pixel Orc, Pixel Landscape, make people feel relaxed and happy, even if you lose, you won't feel sad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The situation of the war is ever-changing, unleash your intelligence and wit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, each type of army has its own characteristics, requiring you to use your intelligence, arrange troops reasonably, and avoid being &quot;stolen&quot; by enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Have fun with friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After opening the game room, invite your friends to join the game in the chat window and organize a big fight between your &quot;little people&quot; and the other party's &quot;little people&quot;.</p>","developers":["\u67ab\u53f6FengYe\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3418670","name":"\u8ff7\u4f60\u738b\u56fd\u6218\u4e89 Mini Kingdom Wars"},"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439190/33567df54bfb20df95c15d77b73b4f0a9e6ae755/header.jpg?t=1744953362","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"\u8ff7\u4f60\u738b\u56fd\u6218\u4e89 Mini Kingdom Wars Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["\u67ab\u53f6FengYe\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germa